Avoid exaggerated enemy reactions that make light attacks look stronger than heavy attacks.

### **7.6 Reduce visual clutter**

When several enemies attack simultaneously, their telegraphs must still be readable under Rudra's elemental VFX.

Ensure that ordinary enemies never produce effects that visually overpower the bosses.

